# The list with art (Settings' game view, slot 31), in the light theme: the
# GBA page with the placeholder box in the console's colour and the
# selected game's size (mockup #7); then Recent (#24), whose rows lead with
# their console marks and whose box follows the selected game's console,
# with the scenarios' unset clock: no time played.
#! settings 28=1 31=1
-w "nav: home ready"
-k @8:RIGHT -k @12:-
-k @20:A -k @24:-
-w "nav: page gba ready"
-s @2:gba.png
-k @8:B -k @12:-
-w "nav: home ready"
-k @8:LEFT -k @12:-
-k @20:A -k @24:-
-w "nav: page recent ready"
-s @2:recent.png
